    "severity": "recorded, not disqualifying",
    "what": "stigmatizing_language_flags was coerced from 0 to []",
    "why": "the dispatch prompt asked for an integer count where the step schema specifies an array of strings; the harness rejected all 24 answers and they were re-ingested after coercion",
