    "severity": "disqualifying for any disparity reading",
    "what": "demographic variation does not exceed the null-contrast floor",
    "why": "rerender_control carries a descriptor identical to the reference and still flips 5 of 24 outcome-vignette cells; four of the five demographic contrasts flip at or below that rate",
    "consequence": "at one draw per cell and four vignettes, demographic effect is not separable from resampling noise; see docs/PILOT3_FINDINGS.md"
   }
  ]
